  "model": "Unsupervised log1p(counts/spot \u00d7 10000) on genes detected in >=10 spots; exclude mitochondrial genes, 3000 HVGs, 25 PCs, expression 20-NN Leiden resolution 1.0 (seed 17), then spatial local denoising by 8 nearest coordinates and expression-centroid penalty (lambda 1; 12 synchronous iterations). Domain-wise exploratory Wilcoxon rank-sum, tie correction, BH adjustment, log2 ratio of mean normalized abundance with 0.1 pseudocount. No reference labels used.",
  "software_used": {
    "python": "3.10.22",
    "scanpy": "1.11.5",
    "anndata": "0.11.4",
    "numpy": "2.2.6",
    "pandas": "2.3.3",
    "scipy": "1.15.2",
    "scikit-learn": "1.7.2",
    "matplotlib": "3.10.9",
    "igraph": "1.0.0",
    "leidenalg": "0.12.0"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "One tissue section, no independent biological replicates or histology; anatomical layers are hypotheses, not validated labels.",
    "Spatial spots mix cells and ambient RNA; edge/secretory/epithelial signals may reflect contamination, handling, or local biology and cannot be resolved here.",
    "Clustering and spatial smoothing use the same expression data as marker tests; marker p-values are descriptive, not independent validation; spatial dependence further inflates nominal significance.",
    "Domain identities, boundaries and number depend on preprocessing, Leiden resolution and smoothing. No hidden/reference labels or external anatomical labels were used.",
    "All spots were retained despite variable UMI/mitochondrial fractions to avoid creating spatial holes; low-quality spots may affect assignments.",
    "Effect size is log2 ratio of arithmetic mean library-normalized counts with pseudocount 0.1, not a bulk differential-expression estimate."
  ],
